sequenceDiagram
    participant App
    participant Shadow as MQTT / Shadow service
    participant Device
    Note over App,Device: R = $vc/devices/device-1/shadow/name/tutorial
    App->>Shadow: PUBLISH R/update (desired intent)
    Shadow-->>App: R/update/accepted
    Shadow-->>Device: R/update/delta
    Device->>Device: Validate schema, range and supported operation
    alt Supported and hardware succeeds
        Device->>Device: Apply and read back actual state
        Device->>Shadow: PUBLISH R/update (truthful reported state)
    else Unsupported or hardware failure
        Device->>Shadow: PUBLISH R/update (actual reported and application-defined lastApply)
        Note over Device: Bound retries for unchanged failing intent
    end
    Shadow-->>Device: R/update/accepted
    App->>Shadow: PUBLISH R/get
    Shadow-->>App: R/get/accepted (current state)
    Note over App: Decide whether to correct desired or surface failure
